    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14721" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀράχν-η</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀράχνης, ἀράχνης ἐν
					ὑφάσματι</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1492
			</span></i> (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.110
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Nicarch.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ λειμώνιαι ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					555b7
				</span></i>
			 (elsewh. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀράχνης,</span> q.v.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>spider's web,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Cord.</u>
				10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				286
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.106
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Lucill.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. λεπταί</span> thin <i>lines,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				10.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφονδύλιον</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.76
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b> kind of
				<i>sundial,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Vitr.
				9.8.1
			</span></i>.</div>
